    {
      "id": "laws",
      "type": "compare",
      "role": "how",
      "duration_s": 16,
      "narration": [
        "Each step of the loop is a lever. Four laws pull them.",
        "Make the cue obvious.",
        "Make the craving attractive.",
        "Make the response easy.",
        "Make the reward satisfying.",
        {
          "who": "asker",
          "say": "And to quit a bad habit, I need a whole new system?",
          "kind": "wrong"
        },
        "No. Flip the same four laws: invisible, unattractive, difficult, unsatisfying."
      ],
